# Studio 交互式澄清问答（ADR-005）

> **知识库：** `openspec/specs/studio-clarification/spec.md`
> **ADR：** `openspec/adr/ADR-005-interactive-clarification-qa.md`
> **change：** `openspec/changes/add-interactive-clarification-qa/`

## 2026-07-06 架构变更（三大决策）

1. **三阶段差异化实现** — 需求分析走 sa-gate 对话流暂停；架构/总体设计走两阶段 Skill 重跑（ThinkAsync 单次消费，return 即 run 结束）
2. **关键题硬门控** — `ClarificationQuestion.Required=true` 必答才推进，仿 `ConfirmRequirementSpecAsync` 范式
3. **完整 IR 事件化** — `ClarificationRequested`(in-progress) / `ClarificationAnswered`(stable) 落事件可审计；`IrProjectionEngine.UpsertClarificationAsync` 补全投影

## 三阶段对比

| 阶段 | 提问入口 | 暂停/恢复 | 答案注入 | nextAction |
|------|---------|-----------|---------|------------|
| 需求分析 | `RequirementGateService.EvaluateMaturity` | sa-gate `sse.Complete();return` | 对话历史→下一轮 maturity | `re-evaluate` |
| 架构设计 | `ArchitectSkillService.GenerateArchitectureClarificationAsync` | 两阶段 Skill 重跑 | answersText→ToT userPrompt | `rerun-architect` |
| 总体设计 | `SystemDesignClarificationSkill.GenerateSystemDesignClarificationAsync` | 两阶段 Skill 重跑 | answersText→SystemDesignLocked.assumptions | `rerun-system-design-clarification` |

## IR 事件与 fragment 状态

| 事件 | fragment 状态 | 触发 |
|------|--------------|------|
| `ClarificationRequested` | `IR1_Clarification` → in-progress | LLM 生成提问 |
| `ClarificationAnswered` | `IR1_Clarification` → stable | 用户作答（required 齐全） |
| `SystemDesignClarificationCompleted` | 留痕（null） | P3 阶段二 |

fragmentId 按 stage 区分：`clarification:{requirement|architecture|system-design}:{projectId}`（同 `IrFragmentTypes.Clarification` 靠前缀区分）

## 主链路（架构阶段两阶段示例）

```
architect-skill 启动
  → ThinkAsync 检查 snapshot.Find(Clarification, Stable) == null
  → GenerateArchitectureClarificationAsync(BudgetGuard LLM)
  → _sseHub.TryPush("clarification_requested", setJson)
  → yield ClarificationRequested → yield break（暂停）
  → ValidateOutputAsync 放行（允许 1 条 ClarificationRequested）
  ↓ 用户作答 POST /skills/clarification/{id}/answer
  → ClarificationAnswered → fragment stable → 返回 nextAction=rerun-architect
  → 前端 runArchitectSkill → architect-skill 重跑
  → ThinkAsync 检查 stable Clarification → 读 answersText → 注入 ToT userPrompt
  → ArchitectureDecisionRecorded
```

## 不变量（BuildClarificationSet / BuildOptions 强制）

- 每题 options 数量 ∈ [3,5]
- 每题末项恒为 `{id:"o_other",label:"其他",freeText:true}`
- type ∈ {single, multi, text}
- required=true 的题 ≤2 个/轮
- round ∈ [1,7]（`Clarification:MaxRounds` 默认 7，触顶强制 refine）

